  "implementation_notes": [
    "The data model, query patterns, API contract, and frontend contract are treated as authoritative; this traceability does not add or alter design behavior.",
    "Where the InitialPOVSpec mentions upload/create embeddings/ask questions, the authoritative contracts only define metadata registration plus persisted chunk/query retrieval. Embedding generation and chunk materialization are external application-layer workflows reflected in stored data.",
    "Ground truth sets have create and get-by-name endpoints, but no list endpoint; this is a known frontend/API limitation already captured in the frontend contract.",
    "Binary file transport and server-side embedding generation are outside the current API contract and therefore appear only as environment/integration dependencies, not as first-class endpoints."
  ]
}